WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.540
Read past first place.

00:00:01.860 --> 00:00:05.200
In RecoScope’s November 24
standing-desks snapshot,

00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:08.460
FlexiSpot appeared in 11 of 12 answers.

00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:10.180
UPLIFT appeared in nine.

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:14.160
Yet all four overall comparison lists
ranked UPLIFT first.

00:00:14.460 --> 00:00:17.280
Here’s the twist:
in that same comparison,

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:19.960
ChatGPT ranked FlexiSpot second,

00:00:20.260 --> 00:00:22.700
then named the E7 Pro its purchase pick.

00:00:22.940 --> 00:00:26.760
That’s a captured recommendation,
not evidence of an actual purchase.

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:29.300
We collected 12 usable answers

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:32.300
across four AI assistants
and three prompt types,

00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:34.620
with one documented technical retry.

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:38.980
FlexiSpot also appeared in all four
under-$600 answers.

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:41.840
Mentions don’t verify checkout prices.

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:45.200
For your brand, track visibility,
overall rank,

00:00:45.260 --> 00:00:47.140
and the final recommendation separately.

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:49.960
These findings don’t establish
product quality.

00:00:50.240 --> 00:00:53.020
Explore benchmark at getrecoscope.com.
